          Subtitle = "Whoa — that was clever! You've really got a knack for this."
        },
        [71002605] = {
          ContentES = "Gracias por tu ayuda. Toma, aquí está tu parte como prometí.",
          DialogueId = 71002605,
          GUID = "B1BF60E2",
          SpeakNpcId = 818023,
          Subtitle = "Thanks for the help. Here's your cut."
        },
        [71002701] = {
          ContentES = "(Los barriles flotan por el canal, algunos emitiendo extraños sonidos. Si los abres con cuidado, podrías encontrar algo útil.)",
          DialogueId = 71002701,
          GUID = "B1BF70A2",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(A few barrels bob along the waterway, some giving off eerie noises. If you open them carefully, you might just find something useful.)"
        },
        [71002702] = {
          ContentES = "(Este barril tiene un gran agujero en el fondo. Aparte del viento que pasa a través de él, no hay nada en su interior. Intenta con otro.)",
          DialogueId = 71002702,
          GUID = "B1BF70CC",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(This barrel has a gaping hole at the bottom. Nothing inside — just the wind whistling through. Better try another.)"
        },
        [71002703] = {
          ContentES = "(Este barril está lleno de basura doméstica. Hace ruidos burbujeantes y huele mal… Intenta con otro.)",
          DialogueId = 71002703,
          GUID = "B1BF70F6",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(This barrel is stuffed with rotting household waste, creating revolting gurgling sounds and a nauseating stench. Better try another.)"
        },
        [71002704] = {
          ContentES = "(La perseverancia da sus frutos: al registrar con cuidado, descubres en un escondite oculto algunos recursos que aún pueden aprovecharse.)",
          DialogueId = 71002704,
          GUID = "B1BF7120",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Patience pays off. After a meticulous search, you spot a hidden compartment — and inside, a stash of usable supplies.)"
        },
        [71002705] = {
          ContentES = "(El barril destartalado se derrumba con un estruendo, atrayendo a los Filthoids cercanos. Derrota a ellos y reclama tu botín.)",
          DialogueId = 71002705,
          GUID = "B1BF714A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The barrel gives a shudder... then collapses with a deafening crack! The noise draws nearby Filthoids to your location. Time to clear them out and claim your well-earned loot.)"
        },
        [71002801] = {
          ContentES = "(Un deslizamiento bloquea el paso frente a ti. Despeja las rocas para continuar.)",
          DialogueId = 71002801,
          GUID = "B1BF810A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(A landslide blocks the path ahead. Clear the rubble to proceed.)"
        },
        [71002802] = {
          ContentES = "(Al limpiar los escombros, localizas algunos suministros todavía utilizables. Mejor no dejarlos aquí.)",
          DialogueId = 71002802,
          GUID = "B1BF8134",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(While clearing the rubble, you find some salvageable supplies. Best not to let them go to waste.)"
        },
        [71002803] = {
          ContentES = "(El ruido atrae a los Filthoids cercanos. Aprovecha las rocas inestables encima para repelerlos.)",
          DialogueId = 71002803,
          GUID = "B1BF815E",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The noise draws nearby Filthoids. Use the unstable rocks above to your advantage and fight them off.)"
        },
        [71002804] = {
          ContentES = "(Tras el combate, revisas los alrededores y encuentras más suministros útiles. Mejor no dejarlos aquí.)",
          DialogueId = 71002804,
          GUID = "B1BF8188",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(After the battle, you scour the area and find more useful supplies. Best not to let them go to waste.)"
        },
        [71002901] = {
          ContentES = "(Bajo las órdenes del sargento, el enemigo avanza metódicamente hacia ti. Mata al sargento lo antes posible para romper su formación.)",
          DialogueId = 71002901,
          GUID = "B1BF9172",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Under the sergeant's command, the enemy advances steadily towards you. Take down the sergeant as fast as you can to disrupt their formation.)"
        },
        [71002902] = {
          ContentES = "(El enemigo se desmorona bajo tu calma y decisiones acertadas.)",
          DialogueId = 71002902,
          GUID = "B1BF919C",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The enemy crumbles under your calm and decisive actions.)"
        },
        [71002903] = {
          ContentES = "(El sargento ha llamado refuerzos. Más enemigos se acercan.)",
          DialogueId = 71002903,
          GUID = "B1BF91C6",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The sergeant has called in reinforcements. More enemies are closing in.)"
        },
        [71003001] = {
          ContentES = "(Los Filthoids inquietos merodean y gruñen, proyectando una sombra ominosa sobre el área. Deshazte de ellos rápidamente.)",
          DialogueId = 71003001,
          GUID = "B1BFA1DA",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Restless Filthoids prowl and snarl, casting a foreboding shadow over the area. Dispatch them quickly.)"
        },
        [71003002] = {
          ContentES = "(La atmósfera se hace aún más pesada, lo sientes: algo siniestro está a punto de manifestarse.)",
          DialogueId = 71003002,
          GUID = "B1BFA204",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The oppressive aura thickens. You sense that something sinister is about to descend.)"
        },
        [71003003] = {
          ContentES = "(Los sonidos de la batalla convocan una calamidad indomable. La encarnación del desastre llega. Mátala, como ya lo has hecho tantas veces.)",
          DialogueId = 71003003,
          GUID = "B1BFA22E",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The sounds of battle summon an indomitable calamity. The avatar of doom arrives. Defeat it, just as you have countless times before.)"
        },
        [71003004] = {
          ContentES = "Con la desaparición de los Filthoids, el aura maligna también se disipa. Por ahora, la zona es segura.",
          DialogueId = 71003004,
          GUID = "B1BFA258",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(With the Filthoids vanquished, the sinister aura dissipates. For now, the area is safe.)"
        },
        [71003101] = {
          ContentES = "(Últimamente, los Geniemons se han convertido en objetivo de cazadores furtivos. Protege al que tienes frente a ti y ahuyéntalos.)",
          DialogueId = 71003101,
          GUID = "B1BFB242",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Lately, Geniemons have become prime targets for poachers. Protect the one before you — and drive them off.)"
        },
        [71003102] = {
          ContentES = "(Se acercan más enemigos.)",
          DialogueId = 71003102,
          GUID = "B1BFB26C",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(More enemies are approaching.)"
        },
        [71003103] = {
          ContentES = "(La amenaza ha pasado. El Geniemon está a salvo.)",
          DialogueId = 71003103,
          GUID = "B1BFB296",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The threat has passed. The Geniemon is safe.)"
        },
        [71003201] = {
          ContentES = "(Un derrumbe bloque el paso. Hay explosivos abandonados por aquí, podrían ayudarte a despejar el camino.)",
          DialogueId = 71003201,
          GUID = "B1BFC2AA",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(A cave-in has blocked your path. Looks like some discarded demolition supplies were left behind. Might be just what you need to clear the way.)"
        },
        [71003202] = {
          ContentES = "(Te topas con el manual de voladuras de los mineros. Está dañado y borroneado en algunas partes, pero todavía se puede descifrar el contenido.)",
          DialogueId = 71003202,
          GUID = "B1BFC2D4",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You come across a battered miner's demolition manual. It's faded and torn — but still legible.)"
        },
        [71003203] = {
          ContentES = "(Encuentras algunos explosivos un poco dañados. Con un poco de arreglo, todavía deberían servir.)",
          DialogueId = 71003203,
          GUID = "B1BFC2FE",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You find a few old explosives. With a little fixing, they should still do the job.)"
        },
        [71003204] = {
          ContentES = "(Encuentras un carrete de mechas usadas. Tras un pequeño arreglo, deberían seguir sirviendo.)",
          DialogueId = 71003204,
          GUID = "B1BFC328",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You find a coil of worn-out fuses. With a little fixing, they should still do the job.)"
        },
        [71003206] = {
          ContentES = "(Sigues las instrucciones del manual e instalas las cargas. Es hora de hacerlas explotar para despejar el túnel.)",
          DialogueId = 71003206,
          Duration = 3,
          GUID = "B1BFC37C",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You follow the manual's steps and rig the charges in place. Time to set them off and clear the tunnel ahead.)"
        },
        [71003207] = {
          ContentES = "(Al limpiar los escombros, localizas algunos suministros todavía utilizables. Mejor no dejarlos aquí.)",
          DialogueId = 71003207,
          GUID = "B1BFC3A6",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Amid the rubble, you spot a few salvageable supplies. No point leaving them behind.)"
        },
        [71003501] = {
          ContentES = "(A lo lejos, algo brilla y llama tu atención. Quizá valga la pena acercarse.)",
          DialogueId = 71003501,
          GUID = "B1BFF3E2",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Something glittering in the distance catches your eye. Might be worth a closer look.)"
        },
        [71003502] = {
          ContentES = "¡Ja! ¡Sabía que ese pedazo brillante atraería a {性别:un Phoxcazador|una Phoxcazadora}! ¡{性别:Atrápalo|Atrápala!}",
          DialogueId = 71003502,
          GUID = "B1BFF40C",
          SpeakNpcId = 818028,
          Subtitle = "Hah! Knew that shiny scrap would reel in a Phoxhunter! Get 'em!"
        },
        [71003504] = {
          ContentES = "¡Ya basta! ¡Paramos! Lo sentimos, no volveremos a hacerlo… ¡lo prometemos!",
          DialogueId = 71003504,
          GUID = "B1BFF460",
          SpeakNpcId = 818028,
          Subtitle = "Alright, alright — we're sorry! We won't do it again... We promise...!"
        },
        [71003601] = {
          ContentES = "(De repente, una estridente sirena rompe el silencio. Una oleada de Drones magnéticos se lanza directamente hacia ti.)",
          DialogueId = 71003601,
          GUID = "B1C0044A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Sudden sirens rip through the silence. A swarm of Magnetix Drones surges towards you.)"
        },
        [71003602] = {
          ContentES = "(La sirena se vuelve más ensordecedora a cada segundo. Otros enemigos se acercan.)",
          DialogueId = 71003602,
          GUID = "B1C00474",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The blare rises to a piercing crescendo. More enemies are closing in.)"
        },
        [71003603] = {
          ContentES = "(El sonido de la alarma va disminuyendo, pero la última oleada se acerca. Aguanta.)",
          DialogueId = 71003603,
          GUID = "B1C0049E",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The alarm wanes — but the final wave approaches. Stand your ground.)"
        },
        [71003604] = {
          ContentES = "(Todos los enemigos yacen en el suelo. La última alarma se apaga con un chisporroteo, y finalmente vuelve el silencio.)",
          DialogueId = 71003604,
          GUID = "B1C004C8",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(All threats neutralised. The last siren sputters and dies, leaving only silence behind.)"
        },
        [71003701] = {
          ContentES = "Uf… hoy realmente no tengo ganas de trabajar…",
          DialogueId = 71003701,
          GUID = "B1C014B2",
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Ugh... I really, really don't feel like working today..."
        },
        [71003702] = {
          ContentES = "No, pero en serio… ¿otra entrega al Lago Lamentoso? ¿No pueden comer en sitios normales o qué? ¿No les da miedo meterse en problemas? De tanto ir de un lado a otro, ya no puedo más…",
          DialogueId = 71003702,
          GUID = "B1C014DC",
          NextDialogue = 71003703,
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Seriously? They want food delivered all the way to Lamenting Lake? Why do people always pick the weirdest places to eat...? Do they care about safety at all? Huff... can't feel my legs..."
        },
        [71003703] = {
          ContentES = "¿Necesitas ayuda?",
          DialogueId = 71003703,
          GUID = "B1C014DD",
          NextDialogue = 71003704,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Need a hand?"
        },
        [71003704] = {
          ContentES = "¡SÍ! ¡Necesito que les des un buen puñetazo a esos clientes! ¡Y que les lances una tormenta entera de bolas de nieve! ¡Así quizá dejen de pedir comida en medio de la nada!",
          DialogueId = 71003704,
          GUID = "B1C014DE",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 710037041,
            [2] = 710037042
          },
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "YES! I need you to punch those customers — real hard! And chuck a whole blizzard of snowballs at them! Maybe then they'll stop ordering food from the middle of nowhere!",
          bForbidSkipOptions = true
        },
        [71003705] = {
          ContentES = "*Suspira*… sí, ya lo sé, solo me estaba quejando un poco. Bueno, ya que estás aquí, ven conmigo. Podemos charlar mientras caminamos. Igual el viaje se hace menos… pesado. Bueno, venga, en marcha.",
          DialogueId = 71003705,
          GUID = "B1C01506",
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "*sigh* Yeah, yeah, I know. Just let me blow off a little steam, alright? Since I bumped into you — why not tag along for a bit? We can chat while we walk. Might make the trip feel less... ugh. Alright then — let's hit the road."
        },
        [71003706] = {
          ContentES = "Uf… con todos estos fragmentos de hielo, si caen en la comida estoy acabado. ¡Tengo que encontrar la forma de despejarlo todo!",
          DialogueId = 71003706,
          GUID = "B1C01530",
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Ugh, all this ice — if it gets into the food, I'm doomed. There's gotta be a way to clear this mess..."
        },
        [71003707] = {
          ContentES = "¡Oh, genial! Ha sido rápido, ¡los platos aún están calientes! Vamos, entreguémoslos antes de que el jefe empiece otra vez con su sermón…",
          DialogueId = 71003707,
          GUID = "B1C01656",
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Whoa — that was fast! The dishes are still warm! Let's get them there now before the boss starts his nag-fest again..."
        },
        [71003708] = {
          ContentES = "¡Socorro! ¡No quiero morir con el estómago vacío!",
          DialogueId = 71003708,
          GUID = "B1C0155A",
          NextDialogue = 71003709,
          SpeakNpcId = 818029,
          Subtitle = "Help! I don't wanna die on an empty stomach!!"
        },
        [71003709] = {
          ContentES = "¿¡Qué!? ¡Lo sabía! ¡De verdad está en peligro! ¡Rápido, vamos a ayudarle! Y si luego le cuenta al jefe que le salvé el pellejo… igual por fin me da una prima… je, je… jejeje…",
          DialogueId = 71003709,
          GUID = "B1C01584",
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Whoa! What did I just say!? Someone's actually in danger! Quick, let's help him! And hey, if he puts in a good word for me with the boss, maybe I'll finally get a raise... Hehe... hehehehe..."
        },
        [71003710] = {
          ContentES = "Uf… sin bichos molestando, una buena comida caliente y vistas al lago… así sí que es la buena vida.",
          DialogueId = 71003710,
          GUID = "B1C015AE",
          NextDialogue = 71003711,
          SpeakNpcId = 818024,
          Subtitle = "Phew! Pesky critters all cleared, warm food in hand, lakeside view... Ahhh, this is the life~!"
        },
        [71003711] = {
          ContentES = "Eh… señor, aún no ha pagado…",
          DialogueId = 71003711,
          GUID = "B1C015D8",
          NextDialogue = 71003712,
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "Um... sir, you haven't paid yet..."
        },
        [71003712] = {
          ContentES = "¿Eh? Pero si solo eres una repartidora, ¿no? ¿Qué sigues haciendo aquí? Apúntalo en la cuenta, ya pagaré la próxima vez que pase por el restaurante.",
          DialogueId = 71003712,
          GUID = "B1C01602",
          NextDialogue = 71003713,
          SpeakNpcId = 818024,
          Subtitle = "Huh? Aren't you just a delivery Luno? Why're you still here? Just put it on my tab — I'll pay next time I'm at the restaurant."
        },
        [71003713] = {
          ContentES = "Pero… si vuelvo con las manos vacías, el jefe me va a echar una bronca monumental…",
          DialogueId = 71003713,
          Duration = 3,
          GUID = "B1C0162C",
          NextDialogue = 71003714,
          SpeakNpcId = 818019,
          Subtitle = "But... I can't just go back empty-handed... The boss's gonna yell at me..."
        },
        [71003714] = {
          ContentES = "(Observas la escena en silencio y avanzas con calma. Nadie se da cuenta de la bola de nieve que se forma en tu mano, lista para salir volando.)",
          DialogueId = 71003714,
          Duration = 4,
          GUID = "B1C0162D",
          NextDialogue = 71003715,
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You've seen enough. Without a word, you follow behind. No one notices the snowball quietly forming in your hand...)"
        },
        [71003715] = {
          ContentES = "¡Aaah! ¿¡Qué es eso!? ¿¡Una bola de nieve!? ¡Pero está heladaaa! ¡Aaaah, mi comida, se cayó al agua! ¡Nooooo—!",
          DialogueId = 71003715,
          GUID = "B1C0162E",
          SpeakNpcId = 818024,
          Subtitle = "Aagh!! What the—!? A snowball!? It's freezing! Aaahhh!! My food — it's in the water! NOOOOO—!!"
        },
        [71003801] = {
          ContentES = "(El túnel está infestado de Filthoids que merodean. ¡Elimínalos!)",
          DialogueId = 71003801,
          GUID = "B1C0251A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The tunnel is infested with roaming Filthoids. Clear them out.)"
        },
        [71003802] = {
          ContentES = "(El estruendo del combate atrae a más. ¡Mantén tu posición!)",
          DialogueId = 71003802,
          GUID = "B1C02544",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The sound of battle stirs the depths — more Filthoids emerge. Hold your line.)"
        },
        [71003803] = {
          ContentES = "(El último Filthoid cae. Por ahora, el túnel está seguro.)",
          DialogueId = 71003803,
          GUID = "B1C0256E",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The last Filthoid falls. For now, the tunnel is safe.)"
        },
        [71003901] = {
          Content = "房间中传来一股肃杀的气息，不安的预感萦绕在心头（待包装）",
          DialogueId = 71003901,
          GUID = "B1C03582",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006
        },
        [71003902] = {
          Content = "齿轮运动的声音响起，敌人正从开启的通道口中窜出（待包装）",
          DialogueId = 71003902,
          GUID = "B1C035AC",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006
        },
        [71003903] = {
          Content = "又是齿轮响动的声音，不远处的两个通道也开启了（待包装）",
          DialogueId = 71003903,
          GUID = "B1C035D6",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006
        },
        [71003904] = {
          Content = "齿轮转动，室内的全部通道均已开启，努力击杀敌人吧（待包装）",
          DialogueId = 71003904,
          GUID = "B1C03600",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006
        },
        [71003905] = {
          Content = "所有通道均已关闭，剩余的敌人将在不久后溃散（待包装）",
          DialogueId = 71003905,
          GUID = "B1C0362A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006
        },
        [71004101] = {
          ContentES = "(El dirigible destrozado parece haberse convertido en un almacén improvisado para la fauna local. Puede que aún haya algo que recuperar.)",
          DialogueId = 71004101,
          GUID = "B1C05652",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The wrecked airship looks like it's been turned into a stash by the local wildlife. There might still be something worth salvaging.)"
        },
        [71004102] = {
          ContentES = "(El ruido de tu registro ha atraído a criaturas hostiles cercanas. Prepárate para defenderte.)",
          DialogueId = 71004102,
          GUID = "B1C056A6",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Your rummaging noises have attracted hostile creatures nearby. Prepare to defend yourself.)"
        },
        [71004103] = {
          ContentES = "(Con el peligro despejado, finalmente puedes revisar tus hallazgos.)",
          DialogueId = 71004103,
          GUID = "B1C056D0",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(With the danger cleared, you finally have time to take stock of your findings.)"
        },
        [71004201] = {
          ContentES = "Mmm hmm… sí, bastante sólido…",
          DialogueId = 71004201,
          GUID = "B1C066BA",
          SpeakNpcId = 818038,
          Subtitle = "Mmm-hmm... Yep. Nice and tough..."
        },
        [71004202] = {
          ContentES = "¿Qué estás haciendo?",
          DialogueId = 71004202,
          GUID = "B1C066E4",
          NextDialogue = 71004203,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "What are you doing?"
        },
        [71004203] = {
          ContentES = "Estoy investigando a los Filthoids. ¿Quieres ayudarme a recolectar algunas muestras de los especímenes?",
          DialogueId = 71004203,
          GUID = "B1C066E5",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 710042031,
            [2] = 710042032
          },
          SpeakNpcId = 818038,
          Subtitle = "I'm studying the local Filthoids! Could you help me gather some specimens?"
        },
        [71004204] = {
          ContentES = "¡Perfecto! Te lo dejo a ti. Voy a descansar un poco, pasar todo el día arrastrándome por ahí casi me mata…",
          DialogueId = 71004204,
          GUID = "B1C0670E",
          SpeakNpcId = 818038,
          Subtitle = "Brilliant! I'll leave the rest to you — my legs are jelly after crawling around all day..."
        },
        [71004205] = {
          ContentES = "¡Aaaah! ¡Todavía quedan Filthoids con vida! ¡No se acerquen! ¡Estoy aquí para estudiarlos yo, no al revés! ¡Fuera!",
          DialogueId = 71004205,
          GUID = "B1C06738",
          GuideFacialId = "Shock",
          HeadIconType = "Npc",
          SpeakNpcId = 818038,
          Subtitle = "Aaaah! Why are there still live ones!? I'm the researcher here — you're the sample! Not the other way round! Shoo!"
        },
        [71004206] = {
          ContentES = "¡Gracias! Las muestras están completas, vuelvo a mis investigaciones. ¡Hasta la próxima!",
          DialogueId = 71004206,
          GUID = "B1C0678C",
          SpeakNpcId = 818038,
          Subtitle = "Thanks a bunch! That wraps up my samples. Back to the lab I go — see you around!"
        },
        [71004301] = {
          ContentES = "(Esta zona siempre está llena de conchas preciosas. La marea ha arrastrado varias cajas hasta la orilla; rómpelas y descubre qué esconden.)",
          DialogueId = 71004301,
          GUID = "B1C07722",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(This stretch of shoreline is known for its lovely seashells. A few crates have washed up with the tide — smash them open and see what's inside.)"
        },
        [71004302] = {
          ContentES = "(En el fondo de una de las cajas encuentras algunas conchas intactas.)",
          DialogueId = 71004302,
          GUID = "B1C0774C",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Among the debris, you uncover a few intact shells.)"
        },
        [71004303] = {
          ContentES = "(Se dice que algunos Filthoids se esconden dentro de las cajas para sorprender a los imprudentes. Desafortunadamente para ellos, esta vez te toparon contigo. Derrótalos y reclama tu premio.)",
          DialogueId = 71004303,
          GUID = "B1C07776",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Tales speak of Filthoids hiding in crates to ambush the unwary. Looks like this batch picked the wrong target. Deal with them and claim your prize.)"
        },
        [71004401] = {
          ContentES = "(La zona está llena de Filthoids. Elimínalos para rescatar al Geniemon.)",
          DialogueId = 71004401,
          GUID = "B1C0878A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The area is swarming with Filthoids. Clear them out to save the Geniemon.)"
        },
        [71004402] = {
          ContentES = "(Los sonidos de la batalla convocan una calamidad indomable. La encarnación del desastre llega. Mátala, como ya lo has hecho tantas veces.)",
          DialogueId = 71004402,
          GUID = "B1C087B4",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The sound of battle draws an indomitable calamity — the avatar of doom descends. Defeat it, just as you have countless times before.)"
        },
        [71004403] = {
          ContentES = "(La zona está segura por ahora. ¡Aprovecha para atrapar al Geniemon!)",
          DialogueId = 71004403,
          GUID = "B1C087DE",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The area is secure for now. You've saved the Geniemon!)"
        },
        [71004501] = {
          ContentES = "(Los enemigos bloquean el acceso a las cajas de suministros. ¡Elimínalos!)",
          DialogueId = 71004501,
          GUID = "B1C097F2",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The path to the supplies is blocked. Eliminate the enemies to proceed.)"
        },
        [71004502] = {
          ContentES = "(La encarnación de la destrucción surge en la zona. Derrótala para recuperar los recursos.)",
          DialogueId = 71004502,
          GUID = "B1C0981C",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The avatar of doom descends upon the area. Defeat it to proceed.)"
        },
        [71004503] = {
          ContentES = "(Los alrededores están seguros… por ahora. Recoge rápidamente los suministros.)",
          DialogueId = 71004503,
          GUID = "B1C09846",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The area is temporarily secure. Gather the supplies while you still can.)"
        },
        [71004601] = {
          ContentES = "(Un montón de cajas de suministros se alza frente a ti. Podría valer la pena echar un vistazo.)",
          DialogueId = 71004601,
          GUID = "B1C0A85A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(A cluster of supply crates lies ahead. Might be worth a closer look.)"
        },
        [71004602] = {
          ContentES = "(Descubres algunos recursos útiles allí.)",
          DialogueId = 71004602,
          GUID = "B1C0A884",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You discover a stash of valuable materials within the crate.)"
        },
        [71004603] = {
          ContentES = "(Se dice que algunos Filthoids se esconden dentro de las cajas para sorprender a los imprudentes. Desafortunadamente para ellos, esta vez te toparon contigo. Derrótalos y reclama tu premio.)",
          DialogueId = 71004603,
          GUID = "B1C0A8AE",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Tales speak of Filthoids hiding in crates to ambush the unwary. Looks like this batch picked the wrong target. Deal with them and claim your prize.)"
        },
        [71004701] = {
          ContentES = "(A lo lejos, algo brilla y llama tu atención. Quizá valga la pena acercarse.)",
          DialogueId = 71004701,
          GUID = "B1C0B8C2",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Something glittering in the distance catches your eye. Might be worth a closer look.)"
        },
        [71004702] = {
          ContentES = "(En el momento en que recoges el objeto, suenan las alarmas. Unidades hostiles se acercan, prepárate para el combate.)",
          DialogueId = 71004702,
          GUID = "B1C0B8EC",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Just as you pick up the item, alarms blare to life. Hostile units are closing in — prepare for battle.)"
        },
        [71004703] = {
          ContentES = "(La alarma se apaga, pero su eco atrae una segunda oleada. Mantén tu posición.)",
          DialogueId = 71004703,
          GUID = "B1C0B916",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The alarm fades, but its echo draws in a second wave. Hold your ground.)"
        },
        [71004704] = {
          ContentES = "(Todos los enemigos yacen en el suelo. La última alarma se apaga con un chisporroteo, y finalmente vuelve el silencio.)",
          DialogueId = 71004704,
          GUID = "B1C0B940",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(All threats neutralised. The last siren sputters and dies, leaving only silence behind.)"
        },
        [71004801] = {
          ContentES = "(A lo lejos, el agudo crujido del hielo rompiéndose resuena en el aire. Vale la pena investigar.)",
          DialogueId = 71004801,
          GUID = "B1C0C92A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(In the distance, the sharp crack of breaking ice echoes through the air. Might be worth checking out.)"
        },
        [71004802] = {
          ContentES = "¿{性别:Un Phoxcazador|Una Phoxcazadora}? Qué buen momento. Las estalactitas que se forman bajo el puente se están convirtiendo en un peligro serio. ¿Te importaría ayudarme a despejarlas?",
          DialogueId = 71004802,
          GUID = "B1C0C954",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 710048021,
            [2] = 710048022
          },
          SpeakNpcId = 818039,
          Subtitle = "A Phoxhunter? Perfect timing. The icicles forming under the bridge are becoming a serious hazard. Mind lending a hand with the clearing?"
        },
        [71004803] = {
          ContentES = "Gracias por tu ayuda. ¿Podrías encargarte de esas de allí?",
          DialogueId = 71004803,
          GUID = "B1C0C97E",
          SpeakNpcId = 818039,
          Subtitle = "Thanks — could you handle those ones over there?"
        },
        [71004805] = {
          ContentES = "Ahí tienes, ahora es mucho más seguro. Toma, es para ti, tu recompensa.",
          DialogueId = 71004805,
          GUID = "B1C0C9D2",
          SpeakNpcId = 818039,
          Subtitle = "That's much better. Appreciate it — here's a little something for your trouble."
        },
        [71004901] = {
          ContentES = "*Suspira*... Imposible cruzar así. Debería haber pensado en comprar Loto de invierno como cebo...",
          DialogueId = 71004901,
          GUID = "B1C0D992",
          SpeakNpcId = 818040,
          Subtitle = "*sigh* ...Should've stocked up on bait. Now I can't even make it across to gather more..."
        },
        [71004902] = {
          ContentES = "¡Eh, {性别:Phoxcazador|Phoxcazadora}! Estoy en un aprieto, necesito algo de Loto de invierno para cebo, pero está al otro lado del lago. ¿Podrías traerme un poco?",
          DialogueId = 71004902,
          GUID = "B1C0D9BC",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 710049021,
            [2] = 710049022
          },
          SpeakNpcId = 818040,
          Subtitle = "Hey, Phoxhunter! I'm in a bit of a pickle — I need some Eclipta Grass for bait, but it's across the lake. Could you fetch some for me?",
          bForbidSkipOptions = true
        },
        [71004903] = {
          ContentES = "¡Gracias! Prepararé mi caña mientras espero tu regreso.",
          DialogueId = 71004903,
          GUID = "B1C0D9E6",
          SpeakNpcId = 818040,
          Subtitle = "Great! I'll get the rod ready while you're at it."
        },
        [71004905] = {
          ContentES = "(La orilla está llena de Filthoids. Será mejor eliminarlos antes de ir a recoger el Loto de invierno.)",
          DialogueId = 71004905,
          GUID = "B1C0DA3A",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(The shoreline is crawling with Filthoids. Best clear them out before gathering the Eclipta Grass.)"
        },
        [71004906] = {
          ContentES = "(Recoges todo el Loto de invierno disponible en los alrededores. Es hora de llevarlo al pescador.)",
          DialogueId = 71004906,
          GUID = "B1C0DA64",
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You collect all the usable Eclipta Grass nearby. Time to head back to the fisherman.)"
        },
        [71004907] = {
          ContentES = "¡Perfecto! Con tanto cebo, no hay manera de que vuelva a casa con el cubo vacío.",
          DialogueId = 71004907,
          GUID = "B1C0DA8E",
          SpeakNpcId = 818040,
          Subtitle = "Perfect! With this much bait, there's no way I'm going home with an empty bucket!"
        },
        [71005001] = {
          ContentES = "¡Eh, ustedes ahí! ¿Podrían tomarme una foto?",
          DialogueId = 71005001,
          GUID = "B1C0E9FA",
          SpeakNpcId = 818041,
          Subtitle = "Hey there! Would you mind taking a photo for me?"
        },
        [71005002] = {
          ContentES = "¡Hola! ¿Pueden ayudarme a sacar unas fotos? Es mi primera vez en Lago Helado, sería una pena irme sin recuerdos.",
          DialogueId = 71005002,
          GUID = "B1C0EA24",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 710050021,
            [2] = 710050022
          },
          SpeakNpcId = 818041,
          Subtitle = "Hello! Would you mind taking a few photos for me? It's my first time in Icelake, and I'd hate to leave without a picture or two.",
          bForbidSkipOptions = true
        },
        [71005004] = {
          ContentES = "¡Genial! No olviden incluir el edificio detrás de mí, me encanta su forma.",
          DialogueId = 71005004,
          GUID = "B1C0EA78",
          SpeakNpcId = 818041,
          Subtitle = "Thank you so much! Make sure you get that lovely building behind me in the frame — love the design."
        },
        [71005005] = {
          ContentES = "¡Tienen un verdadero talento para esto, es perfecto! ¡Muchas gracias!",
          DialogueId = 71005005,
          GUID = "B1C0EAA2",
          SpeakNpcId = 818041,
          Subtitle = "These are fantastic! You've got a real eye for this — seriously, thank you!"
        },
        [71005101] = {
          ContentES = "Ven, pequeño pez, ven.",
          DialogueId = 71005101,
          GUID = "B1C0EAA3",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Come, fish. Come."
        },
        [71005102] = {
          ContentES = "¿Qué haces?",
          DialogueId = 71005102,
          GUID = "B1C0FA62",
          NextDialogue = 71005103,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "What are you doing?"
        },
        [71005103] = {
          ContentES = "Estoy pescando, shh. Ahora no.",
          DialogueId = 71005103,
          GUID = "B1C0FA8C",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Fishing. Shh. Not now."
        },
        [71005104] = {
          ContentES = "(Esperas un buen rato a su lado. Ningún pez pica el anzuelo.)",
          DialogueId = 71005104,
          GUID = "B1C0FA8D",
          NextDialogue = 71005105,
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(You wait quietly beside him. Not a single fish bites.)"
        },
        [71005105] = {
          ContentES = "¿Estás seguro de que esto va a funcionar así, al menos?",
          DialogueId = 71005105,
          GUID = "B1C0FAB6",
          NextDialogue = 71005106,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Are you sure this is how fishing works?"
        },
        [71005106] = {
          ContentES = "Silencio. Solo mira.",
          DialogueId = 71005106,
          GUID = "B1C0FAE0",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Silence. Just watch."
        },
        [71005107] = {
          ContentES = "(Todavía no hay ni un solo pez después de un buen rato.)",
          DialogueId = 71005107,
          GUID = "B1C0FAE1",
          NextDialogue = 71005108,
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(Still no catch after a long wait.)"
        },
        [71005108] = {
          ContentES = "Ven, pequeño pez, ven.",
          DialogueId = 71005108,
          GUID = "B1C0FAE2",
          NextDialogue = 71005109,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Come, fish. Come."
        },
        [71005109] = {
          ContentES = "Creo que al menos se necesita una caña, no solo recitar encantamientos.",
          DialogueId = 71005109,
          GUID = "B1C0FB0A",
          NextDialogue = 71005110,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "You don't even have a rod. I don't think chanting's gonna land you anything."
        },
        [71005110] = {
          ContentES = "Es mi técnica personal después de hablar con mucha gente. ¿Sabes qué tipo de pez pesco al menos? Grandes, muy grandes. ¿No me crees? Atrapa uno y comparamos.",
          DialogueId = 71005110,
          GUID = "B1C0FB34",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "This is a technique I developed after speaking with all sorts of people. The fish I catch? Big. The biggest. You don't believe me? Fine. Catch one yourself. Let's see who's better."
        },
        [71005111] = {
          ContentES = "He atrapado uno. ¿Y tú?",
          DialogueId = 71005111,
          GUID = "B1C0FB5E",
          NextDialogue = 71005112,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Got one. Where's yours?"
        },
        [71005112] = {
          ContentES = "Hmm, es una buena captura, pero la mía es aún más grande.",
          DialogueId = 71005112,
          GUID = "B1C0FB88",
          NextDialogue = 71005113,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Hmm. That's a big one — I'll give you that. But the one I'm after? Even bigger."
        },
        [71005113] = {
          ContentES = "Siento Loto de invierno por aquí, ahuyenta a mis peces. Deshazte de eso y luego veremos.",
          DialogueId = 71005113,
          GUID = "B1C0FC06",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "I smell Eclipta Grass nearby. Its scent is luring my fish away. Clear it out. Then we'll see."
        },
        [71005114] = {
          ContentES = "El “problema” ha sido resuelto. Es hora de volver a ver a ese extraño pescador.",
          DialogueId = 71005114,
          GUID = "B1C0FC30",
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "The \"problem\" has been dealt with. Time to check on the strange angler."
        },
        [71005115] = {
          ContentES = "Listo. ¿Y tu pez?",
          DialogueId = 71005115,
          GUID = "B1C0FC5A",
          NextDialogue = 71005116,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "All done. Now — your fish?"
        },
        [71005116] = {
          ContentES = "Ya lo pesqué, mira.",
          DialogueId = 71005116,
          GUID = "B1C0FC84",
          NextDialogue = 71005117,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Already caught it."
        },
        [71005117] = {
          ContentES = "(Te señala con el dedo.)",
          DialogueId = 71005117,
          GUID = "B1C0FCAE",
          NextDialogue = 71005118,
          SpeakNpcId = 800006,
          Subtitle = "(He points at you.)"
        },
        [71005118] = {
          Content = "钓鱼钓的也可以不是鱼。撒下几句话，做一些奇怪的事，自会有无数鱼争相咬钩。",
          DialogueId = 71005118,
          GUID = "B1C0FCD8",
          NextDialogue = 71005119,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Not every fish has fins, you know. Sometimes all it takes is a few cryptic words and a strange act or two... And something always bites."
        },
        [71005119] = {
          ContentES = "Esto es lo que aprendí al hablar con tanta gente. No te dejes engañar tan fácilmente la próxima vez.",
          DialogueId = 71005119,
          GUID = "B1C0FD02",
          NextDialogue = 71005120,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "That's what I learned from people. Just try not to nibble so easily next time."
        },
        [71005120] = {
          ContentES = "En fin, perdón por la molestia. Toma, esto es para ti. Considéralo como una disculpa.",
          DialogueId = 71005120,
          GUID = "B1C0FD2C",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Anyway — sorry for the mischief. Here. Consider this an apology."
        },
        [71005121] = {
          ContentES = "He atrapado uno. ¿Y tú?",
          DialogueId = 71005121,
          GUID = "B1C0FD56",
          NextDialogue = 71005122,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Got one. Where's yours?"
        },
        [71005122] = {
          ContentES = "Hmm, es una buena captura, pero la mía es aún más grande.",
          DialogueId = 71005122,
          GUID = "B1C0FD80",
          NextDialogue = 71005123,
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "Hmm. That's a big one — I'll give you that. But the one I'm after? Even bigger."
        },
        [71005123] = {
          ContentES = "Escucho a unos Filthoids por ahí, asustan a mis peces. Deshazte de ellos y luego veremos.",
          DialogueId = 71005123,
          GUID = "B1C0FDAA",
          SpeakNpcId = 818045,
          Subtitle = "I heard Filthoids nearby. They scared off my catch. Drive them off. Then we'll see."
        },
        [71005124] = {
          ContentES = "El “problema” ha sido resuelto. Es hora de volver a ver a ese extraño pescador.",
          DialogueId = 71005124,
